EROFS (Enhanced Read-Only File System) — provenance note for the channel fork
==============================================================================

This directory is a backport of the in-kernel EROFS filesystem into the
Motorola SDM632 (msm8953) 4.9 kernel used by the "channel" (Moto G7 Play)
AOSP-17 build.

Origin of this backport
------------------------
The sources here were backported from a Xiaomi msm8953 4.9 kernel tree that
had already staged EROFS onto the 4.9 series, specifically the community trees:

  - github: Renzprjkt/bananadroid  (kernel_xiaomi_ysl_erofs)
  - github: android_kernel_xiaomi_msm8953

Ultimate upstream
-----------------
The canonical upstream of these files is the mainline Linux kernel `fs/erofs/`
subsystem, originally contributed by Huawei (Gao Xiang / Chao Yu et al.).

License
-------
GPL-2.0-only. The original per-file GPL copyright headers (including the
Huawei copyright notices) are preserved unmodified in the source files of this
directory; this note records only the backport provenance and does not alter
those headers.
